sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as 🎮 Client<br/>(Playground + API)
    participant Edge as 🛡️ Edge<br/>(CDN + WAF)
    participant MW as ⚙️ Middleware<br/>(Pipeline)
    participant Route as 🎯 Route<br/>(/analyze)
    participant Signals as 📡 Signal<br/>Registry
    participant Detectors as 🔍 Detectors
    participant Reasoner as 🧠 Risk<br/>Reasoner
    participant Policy as ⚖️ Policy<br/>Engine
    participant Actions as ⚡ Action<br/>Executor
    participant LLM as 🤖 LLM<br/>Service
    participant DB as 💾 Database
    participant Audit as 📋 Audit<br/>Log
    participant Wallet as 💰 Wallet
    participant Usage as 📊 Usage<br/>Service

    Note over Client,Usage: 🎮 Playground Request Flow (/analyze)

    Client->>Edge: POST /api/analyze<br/>{prompt, response}
    Edge->>MW: Forward Request
    
    MW->>MW: RequestIDMiddleware
    MW->>MW: RateLimitMiddleware
    MW->>MW: PlanEnforcerMiddleware
    MW->>MW: SecurityHeadersMiddleware
    MW->>MW: StructuredLoggingMiddleware
    MW->>MW: MetricsMiddleware
    MW->>MW: SystemMetricsCollector
    MW->>Route: Forward to Handler

    Route->>Route: Auth (Clerk JWT)
    Route->>Route: Resolve Org (x-org-id)
    Route->>Route: Load Settings (Baseline)
    
    alt LLM Path (if available)
        Route->>LLM: analyze_with_llm(prompt, response, plan_tier)
        LLM-->>Route: {risk_score, flags, confidence, decision_reason}
        Route->>Reasoner: analyze_aggregated_result(score, flags, confidence)
        Reasoner-->>Route: RiskSummary
        Route->>Policy: evaluate(RiskSummary)
        Policy-->>Route: PolicyDecision
        Route->>Actions: execute(PolicyDecision)
        Actions-->>Route: ActionResult
    else Fallback Path (Deterministic)
        Route->>Signals: run_detectors("prompt", prompt)
        Signals->>Detectors: PromptAnomalyDetector
        Detectors-->>Signals: is_anomalous
        Signals->>Detectors: JailbreakRAGDetector
        Detectors-->>Signals: jailbreak_detected
        Signals->>Detectors: OutputRiskScorer
        Detectors-->>Signals: output_risk_flags
        Signals-->>Route: Aggregated Result
        Route->>Reasoner: analyze_aggregated_result(score, flags, confidence)
        Reasoner-->>Route: RiskSummary
        Route->>Policy: evaluate(RiskSummary)
        Policy-->>Route: PolicyDecision
        Route->>Actions: execute(PolicyDecision)
        Actions-->>Route: ActionResult
    end
    
    Route->>LLM: estimate_tokens(prompt, response)
    LLM-->>Route: token counts
    
    Route->>Wallet: has_sufficient_credits(org_id, cost)
    Wallet-->>Route: boolean
    
    alt Sufficient Credits
        Route->>Wallet: deduct_credits(org_id, cost)
        Wallet-->>Route: OK
    end
    
    Route->>Usage: record_token_usage(org_id, model, tokens, cost)
    Usage-->>Route: OK
    
    Route->>DB: log_risk_event(prompt, response, score, flags, decision, ...)
    DB-->>Route: RiskLog ID
    
    Route->>Audit: log(action="analyze", metadata)
    Audit-->>Route: OK
    
    Route->>Usage: record_event(org_id, endpoint, risk_score, success)
    Usage-->>Route: OK
    
    Route->>DB: log_detection(user, prompt, response, score, flags, action)
    DB-->>Route: Detection Log ID
    
    alt Low Risk Score (< 0.7)
        Route->>Compliance: check_compliance(prompt, response, score)
        Compliance-->>Route: ComplianceResult
        alt Compliance Issue
            Route->>Feedback: report_compliance_issue
        end
    end
    
    Route->>PII: detect_pii(prompt, response, enabled)
    PII-->>Route: {redacted_prompt, redacted_response, pii, flags}
    
    Route-->>Client: AnalyzeResponse<br/>{score, flags, confidence, decision, action_taken, reason, log_id, pii}
    
    MW->>MW: Log request (structured JSON)
    MW->>MW: Record Prometheus metrics
    MW->>MW: Update system metrics (CPU/Memory)
    
    Note right of DB: RiskLog, AuditLog,<br/>UsageEvent, Wallet,<br/>BaselineConfig, Org/Workspace
